WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.301
In Ukraine tonight,

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:01.568
there are

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:04.037
new signs that a highly anticipated

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:07.774
offensive could get underway very soon.

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:09.709
Our chief international security

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:10.510
correspondent,

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:12.212
Nick Paton Walsh, is standing by

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:14.147
in the war zone in Ukraine for us.

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:15.815
Nick, tell us what you saw

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:16.649
during your visit

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:19.352
to the front lines today.

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:20.920
Yeah, Wolf.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:21.421
To be clear,

00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:22.756
Ukraine has yet to announce

00:00:22.756 --> 00:00:24.057
his counteroffensive, indeed

00:00:24.057 --> 00:00:25.091
has said that it may not,

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:26.192
in fact, do that

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:28.028
to ensure operational security.

00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:29.162
But there have been a series

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:29.963
of unconfirmed

00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:31.031
social media reports

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:33.233
suggesting two key occupied cities here

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:34.801
have had important

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:36.102
military and infrastructure

00:00:36.102 --> 00:00:37.771
targets run by the Russians

00:00:37.771 --> 00:00:39.973
meet vicious explosions and so,

00:00:39.973 --> 00:00:41.975
again, that adds to a sense here

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:43.610
of a change in tempo.

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:45.278
Heightened anxiety and tension

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:46.413
that may be suggests

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:47.580
the prelude to this long

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:48.915
awaited counteroffensive

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:49.682
could be underway.

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:51.051
Here's what we saw ourself today.

00:00:52.152 --> 00:00:52.819
Spring is

00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:55.422
here after winter's frozen horror

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:56.523
and the buzz

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:58.091
and sting of Ukraine's

00:00:58.091 --> 00:00:59.592
looming counteroffensive.

00:00:59.592 --> 00:01:00.960
Is growing

00:01:05.932 --> 00:01:07.700
aiming at Russian positions.

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.102
Within 30 seconds,

00:01:09.102 --> 00:01:12.038
the Ukrainian unit has moved away

00:01:12.038 --> 00:01:14.908
But it may be a precise operation,

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:19.079
but the Russian response is not

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:27.320
slamming

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:28.922
into the nearby town,

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:30.657
edging closer to us.

00:01:30.657 --> 00:01:31.724
Impossible to tell

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:33.526
what the Russians are trying to hit.

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:34.561
But another example

00:01:34.561 --> 00:01:36.362
of the intense bombardment

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:37.230
that bid

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:38.865
to stop the counteroffensive

00:01:38.865 --> 00:01:40.233
from starting.

00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:42.302
It is ordinary civilians

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:44.504
caught in the rising dust behind us

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:46.706
who bear the brunt of Russia's

00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:48.808
frustrated rage

00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:53.880
along and around the brutalized towns

00:01:54.114 --> 00:01:55.148
where Ukraine says

00:01:55.148 --> 00:01:57.150
it may launch its attack.

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:58.251
There are more signs

00:01:58.251 --> 00:02:00.920
it is underway lurking in the foliage

00:02:01.321 --> 00:02:03.723
than Ukraine has given, publicly said.

00:02:04.224 --> 00:02:05.358
That's because Ukraine

00:02:05.358 --> 00:02:06.759
has said nothing at all

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:09.429
about when, where or how it will attack

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:11.397
this month.

00:02:11.898 --> 00:02:13.500
But among machine gunfire

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:14.134
in the nearby

00:02:14.134 --> 00:02:16.302
trenches, a drone operators

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:18.304
hidden in the rubble.

00:02:18.338 --> 00:02:20.073
The detailed, intimate picture

00:02:20.073 --> 00:02:21.708
they have of their enemy

00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:24.244
just two fields away is startling.

00:02:25.111 --> 00:02:27.747
Watching and trying to kill each other

00:02:27.914 --> 00:02:29.549
every hour.

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:30.917
They've noticed the Russians

00:02:30.917 --> 00:02:32.418
pulling it back

00:02:34.521 --> 00:02:35.555
Some were still searching

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:36.055
for Syrians

00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:37.157
who came in from Syrian rebels.

00:02:37.157 --> 00:02:39.392
This promises a new formula.

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:40.059
And you see

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:42.128
a tip or two concluded

00:02:42.128 --> 00:02:43.363
by General McKiernan killed

00:02:43.363 --> 00:02:45.064
short of the corner.

00:02:45.265 --> 00:02:46.599
You know, the U.S.

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:49.903
Army shows that the professionalism

00:02:50.503 --> 00:02:52.172
probably the drone

00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:53.606
and you don't know where

00:02:54.774 --> 00:02:56.042
do you draw scenarios here

00:02:56.042 --> 00:02:57.043
and you're still no

00:02:57.043 --> 00:02:59.045
on the Australian people.

00:02:59.045 --> 00:03:00.213
The city was hit with

00:03:00.213 --> 00:03:02.448
another drone team has seen the Russians

00:03:02.682 --> 00:03:04.884
also left defending ruins,

00:03:04.884 --> 00:03:06.853
ridden by chaos in their ranks.

00:03:07.854 --> 00:03:08.688
Just just a little

00:03:08.688 --> 00:03:11.090
disappointment in Australia with some

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:12.091
dudes on the subway.

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:12.692
It was

00:03:13.193 --> 00:03:15.962
sort of possible to convert the neurotic,

00:03:15.962 --> 00:03:16.896
most poignant strain

00:03:16.896 --> 00:03:19.566
to the somewhat switches you can alluded

00:03:19.566 --> 00:03:21.034
streakers on as well as some of that,

00:03:21.034 --> 00:03:23.036
possibly even it.

00:03:23.369 --> 00:03:25.638
It won't be long until that cunning

00:03:25.638 --> 00:03:28.374
or chaos meets a decisive test

00:03:28.741 --> 00:03:31.544
in this flat, open and perilous space.

00:03:34.414 --> 00:03:35.548
Now, Wolf, it's pretty hard

00:03:35.548 --> 00:03:36.583
to disassociate

00:03:36.583 --> 00:03:37.483
the change in tempo

00:03:37.483 --> 00:03:38.284
we've seen around here

00:03:38.284 --> 00:03:38.785
with the idea

00:03:38.785 --> 00:03:39.786
that a counter offensive

00:03:39.786 --> 00:03:40.954
is not pretty imminent.

00:03:40.954 --> 00:03:41.588
In fact,

00:03:41.588 --> 00:03:42.355
the US have said

00:03:42.355 --> 00:03:43.389
just in the last couple of days

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:44.424
that they've been helping train

00:03:44.424 --> 00:03:45.825
the Ukrainians to make sure this is

00:03:45.825 --> 00:03:47.727
a, quote, surprise attack.

00:03:47.727 --> 00:03:48.795
But really, when it begins

00:03:48.795 --> 00:03:49.662
is less important

00:03:49.662 --> 00:03:50.463
than what it manages

00:03:50.463 --> 00:03:51.864
to, in fact, achieve.

00:03:51.864 --> 00:03:53.866
They need a strategic win here

00:03:53.866 --> 00:03:55.435
to show Western backers

00:03:55.435 --> 00:03:56.436
that the military weapons

00:03:56.436 --> 00:03:57.303
they've been supplied

00:03:57.303 --> 00:03:58.571
have been put to good use.

00:03:58.571 --> 00:04:00.640
And to be sure, that support continues.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:03.243
Given the economic electoral fluctuations

00:04:03.243 --> 00:04:04.811
that could happen in the West

00:04:04.811 --> 00:04:06.112
during this next summer,

00:04:06.112 --> 00:04:06.946
really important for

00:04:06.946 --> 00:04:08.081
Kiev to see some success.

00:04:08.081 --> 00:04:09.115
Well, certainly is.

00:04:09.115 --> 00:04:10.883
Nick Paton Walsh in the war zone for us.

00:04:10.883 --> 00:04:11.551
Thank you.

